<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Zoran cut to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Zoran cut to outperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer downgraded Zoran Corp to outperform from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Oppenheimer trimmed the 1997 earnings estimate to $0.59 a share from $0.72 a share and cut the 1998 estimate to $0.79 a share from $1.06 a share, the source said.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday, Zoran posted second quarter earnings of $0.09 a share from $0.10 a share, while revenues dropped to $9.2 million from $11.0 million.</p>
<p>-- Zoran lost 1-5/8 to 17-3/4.</p>
</text>
